    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="python-week1"><a href="#python-week1" class="headerlink" title="python_week1"></a>python_week1</h1><h2 id="1-NC204457"><a href="#1-NC204457" class="headerlink" title="1.NC204457"></a>1.NC204457</h2><figure class="highlight stylus"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs stylus">n = <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>(<span class="hljs-selector-tag">input</span>())<br>num = <span class="hljs-built_in">list</span>(<span class="hljs-built_in">map</span>(int,<span class="hljs-selector-tag">input</span>()<span class="hljs-selector-class">.split</span>()))<br>max_num = <span class="hljs-built_in">max</span>(num)<br>min_num = <span class="hljs-built_in">min</span>(num)<br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">print</span><span class="hljs-params">(max_num - min_num)</span></span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="2-NC209794"><a href="#2-NC209794" class="headerlink" title="2.NC209794"></a>2.NC209794</h2><p>已知三个数的乘积，当这三个数相等时和最小</p><p><code>math.pow(数字, 次方)</code> &#x3D; 计算 <strong>数字 的多少次方</strong></p><figure class="highlight lua"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs lua">import <span class="hljs-built_in">math</span><br>n = int(<span class="hljs-built_in">input</span>())<br>min_sum = <span class="hljs-number">3</span> * <span class="hljs-built_in">math</span>.<span class="hljs-built_in">pow</span>(n,<span class="hljs-number">1</span>/<span class="hljs-number">3</span>)<br><span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;&#123;0:.3f&#125;&quot;</span>.<span class="hljs-built_in">format</span>(min_sum))<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="3-NC52069"><a href="#3-NC52069" class="headerlink" title="3.NC52069"></a>3.NC52069</h2><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python">n,m = <span class="hljs-built_in">map</span>(<span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>,<span class="hljs-built_in">input</span>().split())<br><span class="hljs-comment">#创建一个列表地图grid</span><br>grid = []<br><span class="hljs-comment">#输入，循环每一行，把每一行的字符添加到地图里</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> i <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">range</span>(n):<br>    line = <span class="hljs-built_in">input</span>().strip()<br>    grid.append(line) <span class="hljs-comment">#一行一行存</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">#8个方向,规定向上为-1，向下为1，左是-1，右是1</span><br>dirs = [<br>    (-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>,-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>),(-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>,<span class="hljs-number">0</span>),(-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>,<span class="hljs-number">1</span>),<br>    (<span class="hljs-number">0</span>,-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>),         (<span class="hljs-number">0</span>,<span class="hljs-number">1</span>),<br>    (<span class="hljs-number">1</span>,-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>),(<span class="hljs-number">1</span>,<span class="hljs-number">0</span>),(<span class="hljs-number">1</span>,<span class="hljs-number">1</span>)<br>]<br><span class="hljs-comment">#逐步输出答案</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">#创建一个ans字符串用于输出</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> i <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">range</span>(n):<br>    ans = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;&quot;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> j <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">range</span>(m):<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> grid[i][j] == <span class="hljs-string">&quot;*&quot;</span>:<br>            ans += <span class="hljs-string">&quot;*&quot;</span><br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">continue</span><br>        <span class="hljs-comment">#如果不是雷</span><br>        count = <span class="hljs-number">0</span><br>        <span class="hljs-comment">#8个位置转一圈</span><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> dx,dy <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> dirs:<br>            x = i + dx<br>            y = j + dy<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>&lt;=x&lt;n <span class="hljs-keyword">and</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>&lt;=y&lt;m:<br>                <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> grid[x][y] == <span class="hljs-string">&quot;*&quot;</span>:<br>                    count += <span class="hljs-number">1</span><br>        ans += <span class="hljs-built_in">str</span>(count)<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(ans) <span class="hljs-comment">#每结束一行就输出一行</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="4-NC16710"><a href="#4-NC16710" class="headerlink" title="4.NC16710"></a>4.NC16710</h2><p>求最小公倍数</p><p>最小公倍数 &#x3D; 两数乘积 ÷ 最大公约数</p><p>lcm &#x3D; a * b &#x2F;&#x2F; gcd(a, b)</p><p>辗转相除法就是： 一直用 大数 除以 小数 取余数 然后把小数当新大数，余数当新小数 重复到余数&#x3D;0 最后那个没余数的数，就是最大公约数！</p><figure class="highlight livecodeserver"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs livecodeserver"><span class="hljs-keyword">a</span>,b = map(int,input().<span class="hljs-built_in">split</span>())<br><span class="hljs-comment">#最大公倍数 = 两数乘积除以最大公约数</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">#先求最大公约数</span><br>def gcd(<span class="hljs-keyword">a</span>,b):<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">while</span> b:<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">a</span>,b = b,<span class="hljs-keyword">a</span>%b<br>    <span class="hljs-literal">return</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">a</span><br>lcm = <span class="hljs-keyword">a</span>*b<span class="hljs-comment"> // gcd(a,b)</span><br>print(lcm)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="5-NC17361"><a href="#5-NC17361" class="headerlink" title="5.NC17361"></a>5.NC17361</h2><figure class="highlight stylus"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs stylus">n = <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>(<span class="hljs-selector-tag">input</span>())<br>num = <span class="hljs-built_in">list</span>(<span class="hljs-built_in">map</span>(int,<span class="hljs-selector-tag">input</span>()<span class="hljs-selector-class">.split</span>()))<br>count = <span class="hljs-number">0</span><br>is_up = False<br><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> <span class="hljs-selector-tag">i</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">range</span>(n-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>):<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> num<span class="hljs-selector-attr">[i+1]</span> &gt; num<span class="hljs-selector-attr">[i]</span> :<br>        is_up = True<br>    elif num<span class="hljs-selector-attr">[i+1]</span> &lt; num<span class="hljs-selector-attr">[i]</span> and is_up:<br>        count += <span class="hljs-number">1</span><br>        is_up = False<br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">print</span><span class="hljs-params">(count)</span></span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="6-NC17870"><a href="#6-NC17870" class="headerlink" title="6.NC17870"></a>6.NC17870</h2><figure class="highlight stylus"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs stylus">S = <span class="hljs-selector-tag">input</span>()<span class="hljs-selector-class">.strip</span>()<br>res = -<span class="hljs-number">1</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> <span class="hljs-selector-tag">i</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">range</span>(<span class="hljs-built_in">len</span>(S)-<span class="hljs-number">2</span>):<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> S<span class="hljs-selector-attr">[i:i+3]</span><span class="hljs-selector-class">.upper</span>() == <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;BOB&#x27;</span>:<br>        res = <span class="hljs-selector-tag">i</span><br>        break<br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">print</span><span class="hljs-params">(res)</span></span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="7-NC23046"><a href="#7-NC23046" class="headerlink" title="7.NC23046"></a>7.NC23046</h2><figure class="highlight stylus"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs stylus">T = <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>(<span class="hljs-selector-tag">input</span>())<br><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> <span class="hljs-selector-tag">i</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">range</span>(T):<br>    A,B,P = <span class="hljs-built_in">map</span>(int,<span class="hljs-selector-tag">input</span>()<span class="hljs-selector-class">.split</span>())<br>    ans = <span class="hljs-built_in">pow</span>(A,B,P)<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(ans)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="8-NC204869"><a href="#8-NC204869" class="headerlink" title="8.NC204869"></a>8.NC204869</h2><figure class="highlight vim"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs vim">n,<span class="hljs-keyword">m</span> = <span class="hljs-keyword">map</span>(<span class="hljs-keyword">int</span>,<span class="hljs-built_in">input</span>().<span class="hljs-keyword">split</span>())<br>times = <span class="hljs-keyword">list</span>(<span class="hljs-keyword">map</span>(<span class="hljs-keyword">int</span>,<span class="hljs-built_in">input</span>().<span class="hljs-keyword">split</span>()))<br><span class="hljs-built_in">count</span> = <span class="hljs-number">0</span><br>total = <span class="hljs-number">0</span><br>times.<span class="hljs-keyword">sort</span>()<br><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> i in times:<br>    total += i<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> total &gt;= <span class="hljs-keyword">m</span>:<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">count</span> += <span class="hljs-number">1</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">print</span>(<span class="hljs-built_in">count</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="9-NC214362"><a href="#9-NC214362" class="headerlink" title="9.NC214362"></a>9.NC214362</h2><p>python只有小根堆（堆顶最小），如果想用大根堆，需要以负数的形式存入</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> sys<br><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> heapq  <span class="hljs-comment">#仅支持小根堆</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span>():<br>    nums = sys.stdin.read().split()<br>    heap = []<br>    idx = <span class="hljs-number">0</span><br>    n = <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>(nums[idx]);idx += <span class="hljs-number">1</span><br>    m = <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>(nums[idx]);idx += <span class="hljs-number">1</span><br>    k = <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>(nums[idx]);idx += <span class="hljs-number">1</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> i <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">range</span>(n):<br>        x = <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>(nums[idx])<br>        idx += <span class="hljs-number">1</span><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">len</span>(heap) &lt; k:<br>            heapq.heappush(heap, -x)<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>:<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> x &lt; -heap[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>]:<br>                heapq.heappop(heap)<br>                heapq.heappush(heap, -x)<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> _ <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">range</span>(m):<br>        op = <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>(nums[idx])<br>        idx += <span class="hljs-number">1</span><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> op == <span class="hljs-number">1</span>:<br>            x = <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>(nums[idx])<br>            idx += <span class="hljs-number">1</span><br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">len</span>(heap) &lt; k:<br>                heapq.heappush(heap, -x)<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>:<br>                <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> x &lt; -heap[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>]:<br>                    heapq.heappop(heap)<br>                    heapq.heappush(heap, -x)<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>:<br>            <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(-heap[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>] <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">len</span>(heap) &gt;= k <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> -<span class="hljs-number">1</span>)<br><br><br>main()<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="10-NC230720"><a href="#10-NC230720" class="headerlink" title="10.NC230720"></a>10.NC230720</h2><figure class="highlight awk"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs awk">s = input().strip()<br>n = len(s)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> i <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> range(n-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>):<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> s[i] == s[i+<span class="hljs-number">1</span>]:<br>        print(<span class="hljs-number">2</span>)<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">exit</span>()<br><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> i <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> range(n-<span class="hljs-number">2</span>):<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> s[i] == s[i+<span class="hljs-number">2</span>]:<br>        print(<span class="hljs-number">3</span>)<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">exit</span>()<br>print(-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
    
